# Graphify local knowledge-graph output (generated, never committed)
/graphify-out/

# IDE helper output — generated by `composer ide-helper`, regenerate locally.
# Committing them caused real problems: they drift between branches (the L13
# branch carried dozens of stale `consultant` entries after the elite-yar
# rename), they conflict on nearly every cherry-pick, and they bloat diffs with
# machine-written noise. Nothing at runtime reads them — they exist purely so
# the IDE resolves facades and Eloquent magic properties.
_ide_helper.php
_ide_helper_models.php
.phpstorm.meta.php

# CI contract-diff scratch (.github/workflows/ci.yml → job `contract`).
# `api.json` itself IS committed — it is the baseline the gate compares against.
/api.generated.json
/api.base.json
/contract-changelog.md
/contract-breaking.md
/contract-summary.md

# یک کامیتِ محلی روی `master` این فایل را با کردنشیالِ واقعی وارد گیت کرد
# (DB/MAIL/AWS/PUSHER). آن کامیت عمداً هرگز push نشد. این خط جلوی تکرارش را
# می‌گیرد: `.env` از قبل بود، ولی `env.local` بدونِ نقطه در الگو نمی‌افتاد.
env.local
